{
  "_comment": [
    "Emulators bundled with RetroHub-Setup.exe (read by build.ps1). Every file is downloaded from the project's official",
    "source into <WorkDir>\\downloads\\<id>\\ and checked against its SHA-256 - a changed file on the server never ends up in",
    "the installer. New version: change url/file/version, download, check the file, put its sum here.",
    "target = folder below the RetroHub root; it is exactly emulators\\<catalog id> (Resources\\emulators\\*.json), so",
    "EmulatorRegistry finds the exe in its own folder and the portable data (User\\, user\\, portable\\, config files)",
    "stays at the same place across updates (no version in the folder name). build.ps1 writes version.txt (the",
    "version below) into every emulator folder - RetroHub reads it for exes without a version resource.",
    "NEVER add BIOS files, console keys, firmware or games here."
  ],
